		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Module 03 — Equivalence Engine\n\nCompares the LTL specification (**M_spec**, Module 01) against the code's **WIR** (Module 02) and returns **PASS** or **FAIL + counterexample trace**.","x":620,"y":-320,"width":760,"height":140,"color":"6"},
